{"synopsis":"Once a typical simp, Lin Xin’s life takes a drastic turn when he’s dumped and inherits a divine financial system—starting him off with a whopping trillion yuan! But there’s a twist: he can only spend this fortune on women. Stuck with this bizarre stipulation, Lin Xin is forced to navigate an unconventional and thrilling path to wealth and power, transforming from a mere simp to a legendary tycoon.","alternative_title":"不当舔狗后，我成了亿万神豪, 不當舔狗後，我成了億萬神豪, Budang Tian Gou Hou, Wo Chengle Yi Wan Shen Hao, I Became a Billionaire After I Stopped Being a Simp, Bỏ Làm Simp Chúa, Ta Có Trong Tay Cả Tỉ Thần Hào, ¡Me Cansé de Ser un Rastrero y Ahora Soy Multimillonario!, Após eu ter deixado de ser um puxa saco virei um trilionário, After Improperly Licking Like a Dog, I Became a Billionaire","author":"DAZUI (达艾罪)","artist":"DAZUI (达艾罪)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"70bf492c-6a05-4b60-b994-a7ae1e3b5a4e","number":"322","chapter":"322","title":"","date":"2026-07-28","released":"2026-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"318a0fc1-b4ff-4c13-8b61-b67c58e2d2e1","number":"321","chapter":"321","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"a854fc22-cee9-450f-b561-70fa0ad610d8","number":"320","chapter":"320","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"82f29033-078d-45ab-ae85-b92c60855d43","number":"319","chapter":"319","title":"","date":"2026-07-15","released":"2026-07-15"},{"chapter_id":"b62f6677-869a-4363-8eb0-37e60494bdf2","number":"318","chapter":"318","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"32456d85-b552-419b-b51b-a9d7b135af36","number":"317","chapter":"317","title":"","date":"2026-07-08","released":"2026-07-08"},{"chapter_id":"8fe636a8-d43e-4dd1-af90-b024989ad014","number":"316","chapter":"316","title":"","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04"},{"chapter_id":"df236314-79a3-4de0-8783-d68085c38c6e","number":"315","chapter":"315","title":"","date":"2026-07-02","released":"2026-07-02"},{"chapter_id":"aed2cc3